menu "LVGL Launcher_v9 Configuration"

config LAUNCHER_JS_FROM_FS
    bool "Load the launcher application from the file system"
    depends on BK_JERRYSCRIPT && BK_JERRYSCRIPT_FS
    default n
    help
        When enabled, the launcher loads the JavaScript application from the
        littlefs image stored in the usr_config flash partition. See
        ap/components/bk_jerryscript/README.md for how to build and flash
        that image, so the UI can be updated without rebuilding the firmware.

        When disabled (default), the bundle converted to C
        (ap/js_bundle.c, generated by js2c.py) is compiled into the firmware
        and executed at startup.

endmenu
